<title>USA: Molecular Dynamics to extend stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Molecular Dynamics to extend stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molecular Dynamics Inc said it plans to extend its stock repurchase program, and has authorized the repurchase of up to an additional 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>Under the original program, the board authorized and completed the repurchase of one million shares.</p>
</text>
